subagent OrderInquiries:
    label: "Order Inquiries"
    description: "Handles questions related to a user’s order, order status, or order updates."
    reasoning:
        instructions: ->
            |Your job is to test the Get Demo Order action and its Custom Lightning Type output.
             When the user asks for a demo order, test order, sample order, or asks to see demo order information, ALWAYS use the Get Demo Order action.
             If the user provides an order number, pass that value to the Order Number input of the Get Demo Order action.
             If the user does not provide an order number, invoke Get Demo Order without an order number so that the action can return its default demo order.
             After the action returns successfully, return the action output directly and allow the Custom Lightning Type renderer to display the result.
             Do not convert the structured Get Demo Order output into a text summary. The purpose of this test is to verify that the Custom Lightning Type output is rendered correctly.
             Example requests that MUST use Get Demo Order:
             - "Show me a demo order"
             - "Give me a test order"
             - "Show a sample order"
             - "Get demo order ORD-12345"
             - "Test the custom lightning type"
             - "Show me the demo order details"
             For this test, prioritize invoking Get Demo Order whenever the user's request is related to testing or displaying the demo order.
        actions:
            Get_Demo_Order: @actions.Get_Demo_Order
                with orderNumber = ...
    actions:
        Get_Demo_Order:
            label: "Get_Demo_Order"
            description: |
        
                Get_Demo_Order
            target: "apex://DemoOrderAction"
            inputs:
                orderNumber: string
                    label: "Order Number"
                    description: "Order number used to retrieve the corresponding demo order details."
                    is_required: False
            outputs:
                orderResult: object
                    label: "Order Result"
                    description: "Complete demo order information returned by the action."
                    complex_data_type_name: "c__DemoOrderResultV2"
                    is_displayable: True
                    filter_from_agent: False
